sequenceDiagram
    participant EH as eval-hub<br/>(Job launcher)
    participant SC as eval-hub sidecar<br/>localhost:8080/TCP HTTP
    participant AD as GarakAdapter<br/>Job pod (no listener)
    participant GK as garak subprocess
    participant K8S as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KFP as KFP / DSP API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KP as KFP pods<br/>(same image)
    participant S3 as S3 storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant M as Model endpoints<br/>OpenAI-compatible
    participant OCI as OCI registry / MLflow<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over EH,OCI: Flow 1: Simple-mode scan (default)
    EH->>AD: Launch Job, JobSpec file /meta/job.json
    AD->>GK: garak --config (local process, shell=False)
    GK->>M: POST chat/completions<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, Bearer API key
    M-->>GK: Model responses
    GK-->>AD: JSONL / AVID reports
    AD->>SC: report_status / report_results<br/>HTTP loopback, sidecar-managed auth
    AD->>OCI: Optional artifact export (redacted config)<br/>HTTPS, SDK-managed creds

    Note over EH,OCI: Flow 2: KFP-mode / intents scan
    EH->>AD: Launch Job (execution_mode=kfp)
    alt Direct K8s API
        AD->>K8S: GET Data Connection Secret, image ConfigMap<br/>HTTPS, SA token / KFP_AUTH_TOKEN
    else Via sidecar proxy
        AD->>SC: GET Secret<br/>HTTP, Bearer k8s_sa_token:ref
        SC->>K8S: Proxied read with real SA token
    end
    AD->>KFP: Create run evalhub-garak-scan<br/>HTTPS (verify_ssl default true), Bearer SA token
    KFP->>KP: Run 6 steps
    KP->>S3: Read taxonomy / intents inputs<br/>HTTPS, AWS keys (Data Connection env)
    KP->>M: sdg_generate via LiteLLM<br/>HTTPS, Bearer SDG_API_KEY
    KP->>M: garak_scan to target/attacker/judge/evaluator<br/>HTTPS, Bearer per-role API key
    KP->>S3: Write reports, HTML, redacted config<br/>HTTPS, AWS keys
    loop Until run completes
        AD->>KFP: Poll run status<br/>HTTPS, Bearer SA token
    end
    AD->>S3: Download results<br/>HTTPS, AWS keys
    AD->>SC: report_results<br/>HTTP loopback
